# Build output
/render
/out.png
*.test
*.out

# Per-page montages for the larger (100/500-page) bench corpora: bench/out/
# (the canonical ten-page corpus) IS committed since it is small (~11MB,
# 10 files), but the same policy at 100x-500x the page count would be
# hundreds of megabytes of binary PNGs in git history permanently. The
# measured numbers that matter (bench/REPORT-100.md, bench/REPORT-500.md,
# bench/results-100.json, bench/results-500.json) ARE committed; the
# montages themselves are reproducible by re-running the documented bench
# command against bench/urls-100.txt / bench/urls-500.txt.
/bench/out-100/
/bench/out-500/

# Editor/OS cruft
.DS_Store
